<title>USA: BOXING-GATTI RETAINS IBF JUNIOR LIGHTWEIGHT TITLE BY DECISION.</title>
<headline>BOXING-GATTI RETAINS IBF JUNIOR LIGHTWEIGHT TITLE BY DECISION.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTIC CITY, New Jersey 1997-02-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arturo Gatti of Canada retained his International Boxing Federation junior lightweight title with a unanimous points decision over American Tracy Patterson on Saturday.</p>
</text>
